                                    <div class="aboutOverviewPro text-justify">
                                        <p>
                                            <p>Rustomjee Meridian is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Kandivali West locality of Mumbai. Spanning 1.25 Acres, the project features 160 Units in 2 Towers, offering a mix of 1 BHK+1T, to 2 BHK+2T Apartments ranging from 449 sqft to 661 sqft. The address for the project is charkop, kandivali west, mumbai.</p>

<p><strong>Available Property Sizes</strong></p>

<p>The Apartments at Rustomjee Meridian are available in a variety of sizes. The 1 BHK+1T units start at 449 sqft. The larger 2 BHK+2T Apartments go up to 661 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.</p>

<p><strong>Price Range</strong></p>

<p>The prices for the Apartments at Rustomjee Meridian are designed to be accessible, with 1 BHK+1T units priced from 1.17 Cr and 2 BHK+2T Apartments from 1.73 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.</p>

<p><strong>Developer Information</strong></p>

<p>The project is being developed by Rustomjee Constructions, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is RERA Received Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2016-06-19, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.</p>

<p><strong>Amenities and Features</strong></p>

<p>Rustomjee Meridian is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Waste Disposal, Maintenance Staff, Wi-fi connectivity, Multipurpose Hall, Cafeteria. The security features include  for enhanced safety.</p>

<p><strong>Construction and Specifications</strong></p>

<p>The project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.</p>

<p><strong>Key Information</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li>
	<p>Total Area: 1.25 Acres</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Units &amp; Towers: 160 Units, 2 Towers</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Sizes: 449 sqft to 661 sqft</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Project Address: charkop, kandivali west, mumbai</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Type: Residential Apartments</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Developer: Rustomjee Constructions</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>RERA Registration No.: RERA Received Units</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Possession Start: 2016-06-19</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Security: </p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Sports Facilities: Sports Facility</p>
	</li>
	<li>
	<p>Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage, Waste Disposal, Maintenance Staff, Wi-fi connectivity, Multipurpose Hall, Cafeteria</p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Location Benefits</strong></p>

<p>Rustomjee Meridian benefits from its location in Kandivali West, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.</p>

<p><strong>Developer and Project Details</strong></p>

<p>Possession at Rustomjee Meridian will begin in 2016-06-19, and the project is RERA registered under RERA Received Units. Developed by Rustomjee Constructions, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.</p>
                                    </p>
